      "paragraph": "(g)(1)",
      "description": "Paragraph (g) acts on disks \"listed in Table 1\", an image (ER02JY21.000) that pairs engine serials with disk serials. Whether it lists exactly the (c)(1) disks, and whether an engine whose serial differs from the pairing is covered, cannot be read from the text.",
