        "Table 1 lists the (c)(1) disks; every engine with one is covered.",
        "Only the engine and disk pairs in table 1 are covered."
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph": "(a)",
      "description": "The AD was effective on actual notice of Emergency AD 2021-11-51 (issued May 21, 2021), so the 10-FC clock starts on each operator's notice date, not always July 19, 2021.",
      "readings": [
        "From the operator's date of actual notice.",
        "From July 19, 2021, without actual notice."
      ]
    },
